### GET current locale info
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/current-locale

### GET greeting with language header
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/greetings
Accept-Language: tr

### Send POST request for user record validation failure
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: tr

{
  "email": "invalid-email-format",
  "password": ""
}
